# An application of an abstract object, which is an attribute of another one.
#
#   ⟦ bar ↦ ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ y ↦ ∅, φ ↦ ξ.y ⟧ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.bar.a(y ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 bar foo
F c1 a
F c2 y φ
D c3 c2 y
P c2 φ c3
P c1 a c2
P c0 bar c1
D c4 c0 bar
D c5 c4 a
F c6
Δ c6 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
A c7 c5 y c6
P c0 foo c7
